      en: ["More than 6,000 rock carvings have been discovered across various sites in Alta.", "The Northern Lights Cathedral stands 47 meters tall.", "The Finnmarksløpet is Europe's longest dog sled race at 1,200 km.", "Alta was granted city status in 1999.", "The polar night in Alta lasts from November 25 to January 17.", "The Tirpitz Museum in Alta documents the history of the German battleship."],
